{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15526","headline":"军中醉饮寄沈八刘叟 · 畅当","name":"军中醉饮寄沈八刘叟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"酒渴爱江清，余酣漱晚汀。\n软莎欹坐稳，冷石醉眠醒。\n野膳随行帐，华音发从伶。\n数杯君不见，都已遣沈冥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"畅当","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15526.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15526","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}